{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"최종화","artist":"아이리 칸나","date":"2026-09-08","sourceId":"15101264:009","sourceHash":"cf357ca7538b356fec76e0507225a4272c0f2cf5eae4e78a33a50e68cd60b60e","duration":58.0,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":16.35,"end":22.3,"text":"질리지도 않고 나를 처방하는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":22.48,"end":28.5,"text":"만약이라는 말","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":28.55,"end":31.8,"text":"항상 똑같은 매일은 내성이 되어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":32.15,"end":35.1,"text":"내일을 어지러이 무너뜨려","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":35.31,"end":39.8,"text":"쓰라린 날에 쓰라린 나를 삼키지 못해","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":39.92,"end":45.6,"text":"뱉어내고 싶었던 밤","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":45.65,"end":50.7,"text":"의미도 없이 건넨 위선의 말","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":50.96,"end":54.5,"text":"추락을 향해 올라가는 날 만들어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}